Rule 4 (colors tensor should have 2 dimensions)
{colors : tensor} |= ndim(colors) = 2
>>
Rule 5 (images and boxes tensors should have the same batch size)
{images : tensor, boxes : tensor} |= shape(images, 0) = shape(boxes, 0)
>>
Rule 6 (boxes and colors tensors have same num_bounding_boxes)
{boxes : tensor, colors : tensor} |= shape(boxes, 1) = shape(colors, 0)
