Rule 13 (minimum bounding box coordinate should be non-negative and maximum should be less than or equal to 1.0)
{boxes : tensor} |= min(boxes) ≥ 0.0 ∧ max(boxes) ≤ 1.0
>>
Rule 14 (The number of channels in images should match the last dimension)
{images : tensor} |= shape(images, 3) > 0
>>
Rule 15 (colors tensor's last dimension should be 4)
{colors : tensor} |= shape(colors, 1) = 4
>>
Rule 16 (images, boxes and colors tensors must have the floating point type)
{images : tensor, boxes : tensor, colors : tensor} |= dtype_(images) = 7 ∧ dtype_(boxes) = 7 ∧ dtype_(colors) = 7
