Rule 21 (images, boxes and colors tensors must all have the same dtype)
{images : tensor, boxes : tensor, colors : tensor} |= dtype_(images) = dtype_(boxes) ∧ dtype_(boxes) = dtype_(colors)
>>
Rule 22 (The number of colors should be greater or equal to 1)
{colors : tensor} |= shape(colors, 0) ≥ 1
