Rule 24 (Height of images should be greater than 0)
{images : tensor} |= shape(images, 1) > 0
>>
Rule 25 (Width of images should be greater than 0)
{images : tensor} |= shape(images, 2) > 0
>>
Rule 26 (Batch size of images should be greater than 0)
{images : tensor} |= shape(images, 0) > 0
>>
Rule 27 (Number of bounding boxes should be greater or equal to 0)
{boxes : tensor} |= shape(boxes, 1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 29 (The color values should between 0 and 1)
{colors : tensor} |= min(colors) ≥ 0 ∧ max(colors) ≤ 1
